#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""SiriusXM for Omarchy: account login, a local HLS proxy, and mpv control.

One file, standard library only. `sxm daemon` runs a localhost HTTP server
that logs in to the SiriusXM edge gateway, serves rewritten live playlists,
decryption keys and segments to mpv, owns the mpv process, and writes a
status file the shell widget watches. Every other subcommand is a thin
client of that daemon (started on demand).

The edge-gateway flow follows yob15662/sxm-player (Apache-2.0).
"""

